<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank to list 10.8 mln shrs Aug 18.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank to list 10.8 mln shrs Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw Stock Exchange on August 18 will add 10,847,000 shares of Polish bank Kredyt Bank SA to the 25,162,935 already in bourse trade, the bourse said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In April the bank offered investors 10 million shares in a public offering and the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) 847,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
